  "title": "Hidamari Sketch x Special",
  "justification": "Episode 1 \"July 15th: As You Feel It / August 28th: Bobble\" (2011-10-30) and episode 2 \"May 9th: Splish Splash!! / May 25th: Welcome! It's the Meat Village\" (2011-11-06) are TVDB season 0 episodes 8 and 9 under those titles and TMDB 45893 season 0 episodes 8 and 9. The row split them over episodes 8-11, sending episode 2 to the \"Sae Hiro\" graduation episodes 10-11, and TMDB placed them on episodes 1-2. Special S1, the picture drama, has no TVDB or TMDB episode; by default it fell on season 0 episode 1, the first season's \"August 11th\" special (AniDB 4743), so it is unmapped.",
